  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the delivery of public services to the people of the Caribbean and to support the sustainability of  public finances  by strengthening macroeconomic policymaking, public financial management, revenue mobilisation  and by helping to avert a financial sector crisis in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
